<title>USA: AMEX to trade LEAPS on Barnett Banks.</title>
<headline>AMEX to trade LEAPS on Barnett Banks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said Thursday it would begin trading LEAPS (Long Term Equity Anticipation Securities) on Barnett Banks Inc on Friday, May 23.</p>
<p>The exchange said the options would open with strike prices of 40, 50 and 60 and will have expirations in January 1999 and January 2000.</p>
<p>Spear, Leeds &amp; Kellogg will be the specialist unit.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
